    "Gold, Edelsteine, Wildcards, Rang, Mastery und Quests zur Website senden.": ["Send gold, gems, wildcards, rank, mastery and quests to the website.","Envoyer or, gemmes, jokers, rang, maîtrise et quêtes au site.","Enviar oro, gemas, comodines, rango, maestría y misiones al sitio.","Invia oro, gemme, jolly, grado, mastery e quest al sito.","Enviar ouro, gemas, curingas, rank, mastery e missões para o site.","ゴールド・ジェム・ワイルドカード・ランク・マスタリー・クエストをサイトへ送ります。"],
